# ROADMAP MERGE — gates

**Канон:** `memory-bank/<role>/roadmap/queue.yaml` (yaml-only, `roadmap-queue/v2`)  
**Алгоритм:** @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-roadmap-merge.mdc  
**CLI:** `context_loop.py roadmap-merge`

## Gates

1. Inventory `roadmap/queue.yaml` (+ leftover batches/legacy)
2. Skip done (QA pass / DONE); dedup id; plan conflict → halt
3. Topo hard deps; soft только в slug md
4. Canon + md записаны; slug sources не удалены
5. `activeContext` / `tasks.md` указывают на canon; next = DECOMPOSE first active
